# The images are built with the repository root as context: keep out what they do not need, and
# above all the local secrets. The gateway image does need web-client (it compiles the page), but
# not what is built or installed in it.
.git
# Any .env, also the ones inside a folder (Vite writes VITE_* variables of web-client/.env into the
# page, and the page is public).
**/.env
**/.env.*
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
docs
observability
database
services/air-quality-service
web-client/dist
